# Ignore by location, never by extension.
#
# Every generated or fetched artifact lands under one of the roots named below,
# so no rule here needs a negation exception. If a new kind of output appears,
# give it a home under data/, out/ or var/ rather than adding a pattern for its
# file extension -- that is how the previous version of this file ended up with
# eleven `!` escapes and 78 tracked-but-ignored files.

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# --- Build artifacts ---
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# --- Tooling caches ---
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Generated and fetched trees (see src/inferq/paths.py) ---
# /data/  external datasets fetched by `inferq data fetch`
# /out/   run output: results, figures, exports
# /var/   machine-local state: the circuit store, caches, logs
/data/
/out/
/var/

# --- Legacy output locations, kept until every runner is migrated ---
/circuits/
/circuits_hpc/
/test_circuits/
/logs/
/pgdata/

# --- Research artifacts too large for git ---
# Paper numbers are pinned to these exact files, so they are archived rather
# than regenerated. docs/provenance/purged-data-sha256.txt records the sha256 of
# each one; restore them there and `shasum -a 256 -c` will confirm the match.
# Listed one by one rather than by glob: their sibling files in the same
# directories are small and stay tracked, and a glob here would silently swallow
# those the next time one is regenerated.
/experiments/analysis/training_data/estimator_training_data.parquet
/experiments/analysis/training_data/rdbms_training_data.parquet
/experiments/analysis/training_data/selector_training_data.parquet
/experiments/analysis/memory_profiling/sqlite_vs_qiskit_results.jsonl
/experiments/analysis/finetuned/rdbms7705_sqlite_static_contr/rdbms7705_sqlite_static_contr_manifest.csv
/experiments/analysis/finetuned/rdbms7705_sqlite_static_contr/rdbms7705_sqlite_static_contr_results.csv
/experiments/analysis/finetuned/rdbms7705_sqlite_static_contr/rdbms7705_sqlite_static_contr_vs_baseline_qiskit_prism.csv

# --- Secrets ---
# The one extension-scoped block. Failing open here is catastrophic and no
# tracked file matches.
.env
*.key
*.pem

# --- Editors and scratch ---
.DS_Store
.kiro/
playground.ipynb
